{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickles in a jar, nerves on edge!</strong><br>Pickle Panic is a physics-based co-op platform/party game where you and your team steer pickles inside a glass jar through courses full of swinging hammers, falling boulders, and rotating columns. The goal is simple: <strong>reach the finish without breaking the jar.</strong> It\u2019s easy to pick up, but mastering it together takes real coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the team affects the jar\u2019s balance and speed. Lean, push, and brake; share momentum to cross bridges, slopes, and wild contraptions. <strong>Dynamic damage</strong> based on impact speed will crack the jar; push too hard and you\u2019ll all <strong>respawn at the last checkpoint.</strong> Communication is key\u2014panic guaranteed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player online co-op</strong> (solo-friendly as well)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/b9fbfa0d09d836f6ca657869724b920b.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/b9fbfa0d09d836f6ca657869724b920b.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/b9fbfa0d09d836f6ca657869724b920b.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven jar control:</strong> weight, friction, momentum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/35f4ab35204c42d49738fa244ba04281.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/35f4ab35204c42d49738fa244ba04281.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/35f4ab35204c42d49738fa244ba04281.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied hazards:</strong> swinging hammers, falling rocks, rotating columns, moving platforms, and more\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/1bff70c74b31651132024793d9f2bea0.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/1bff70c74b31651132024793d9f2bea0.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/1bff70c74b31651132024793d9f2bea0.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable jar &amp; health system:</strong> speed/impact-based damage with smart checkpoints</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/773fa385383944e5210177588d4ef3ac.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/773fa385383944e5210177588d4ef3ac.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/773fa385383944e5210177588d4ef3ac.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-first design:</strong> easy to learn, master together\u2014chaos turns into comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/7f4b6470828962ec7188e11a415274cd.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/7f4b6470828962ec7188e11a415274cd.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/7f4b6470828962ec7188e11a415274cd.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and get that jar to the finish line without cracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/ccc9673b43864af02f61b745aae4812a.poster.avif?t=1772986853\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/ccc9673b43864af02f61b745aae4812a.webm?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/ccc9673b43864af02f61b745aae4812a.mp4?t=1772986853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726940?t=1772986853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726940?t=1772986853","capsule_image":"h